ource":{"type":"schematic","want":"direct"},"status":"draft","note":"PLF (O.S.), „von allen Seiten vom Chor verstärkt“: einmal groß, zweimal als Echo. Keine Luft – der Ruf füllt den Screen."},{"id":"sb-38-10","format":"vertical","aspect":"1:3","projection":"perspective","move":"tilt-down","shot":{"size":"full","angle":"eye"},"location":"garden","view":"real","light":{"key":"right","height":"low","rim":true,"note":{"de":"Gegenlicht-nah: PLF steht auf, die Sonne rechts hinter den Stauden, ein heller Rand um das Gewand."}},"action":{"de":"PLF steht entschlossen auf, klopft sich die Erde vom Gewand und tritt in den Gang zwischen zwei Beetreihen, die in die Abendsonne führen."},"air":[[0,15]],"figures":[{"cast":"plf","framing":"full","mood":"neutral","pose":"stand","facing":"three-quarter-right","x":0.45,"y":0.6,"h":0.4}],"dialog":[{"variant":"narration","font":"mono","rect":{"x":6,"y":18,"width":40},"text":{"de":"PLF begann mit der Übung."}},{"variant":"bubble","rect":{"x":50,"y":44,"width":42},"tail":"bottom-left","text":{"de":"5 Dinge, die ich sehe!"}}],"source":{"type":"schematic","want":"direct"},"status":"draft"}]},{"label":"scene-38-garden","renderer":{"type":"horizontal","params":{"endless":true}},"continues":true,"shots":[{"id":"sb-38-11","format":"loop360","aspect":"3:1","projection":"perspective","move":"look-around","shot":{"size":"wide","angle":"eye"},"location":"garden","view":"real","light":{"key":"right","height":"low","accent":{"color":"blue","on":"die Yves-Klein-blauen Wasserspeicher"},"note":{"de":"Rundum dieselbe tiefe Sonne: auf der Sonnenseite Gegenlicht und Silhouetten, auf der anderen Seite alles hart angestrahlt mit langen Schatten. Das Blau der Wasserspeicher als einzige Farbe."}},"action":{"de":"360°-Panorama des Gartens im Abendlicht, Beetreihen ringsum. Reihum die fünf Dinge: Tomatenstauden an Stäben; ein Polster Thymian; Baby-Chili-Paprika; Gießkannen, die wie Krokodile aussehen (langer Ausguss, Zahnrand); aufgebockte Wasserspeicher aus Yves-Klein-blauem Plastik. PLF streift durch die Reihen."},"air":[],"figures":[{"cast":"plf","framing":"full","mood":"neutral","pose":"walk","facing":"right","x":0.1,"y":0.6,"h":0.3}],"dialog":[{"variant":"narration","font":"mono","rect":{"x":1,"y":8,"width":14},"text":{"de":"Während PLF durch die Beetreihen streifte, zählte sie mechanisch auf:"}},{"variant":"narration","font":"mono","rect":{"x":18,"y":70,"width":13},"text":{"de":"Tomatenstauden."}},{"variant":"narration","font":"mono","rect":{"x":35,"y":70,"width":13},"text":{"de":"Thymian."}},{"variant":"narration","font":"mono","rect":{"x":51,"y":70,"width":14},"text":{"de":"Baby-Chili-Paprika."}},{"variant":"narration","font":"mono","rect":{"x":68,"y":70,"width":14},"text":{"de":"Krokodilartige OBI-Gießkannen."}},{"variant":"narration","font":"mono","rect":{"x":84,"y":70,"width":14},"text":{"de":"Wasserspeicher aus – nun ja, beinahe Yves-Klein-blauem – Plastik."}}],"source":{"type":"schematic","want":"generated"},"status":"draft","note":"Der Loop passt: das Aufzählen ist ein Umsehen – der Leser findet die fünf Dinge beim Ziehen wie PLF. Eine Box pro Slide (6 Slides) – deshalb die Warnung „Boxen pro Screen“ (falscher Alarm: verteilt auf 6,5 Screens Breite).","prompt":{"en":"Seamless 360-degree panorama of a lush, orderly vegetable garden at sunset, rows of raised beds all around: tomato plants on stakes, a cushion of thyme, small chili pepper plants, green watering cans shaped like crocodiles, and raised plastic water tanks in vivid Yves Klein blue. A person in a white robe walks between the rows. Low sun, very long black shadows; black and white except the blue tanks."}}]},{"label":"scene-38-b","renderer":{"type":"vertical"},"continues":true,"shots":[{"id":"sb-38-12","format":"viewport","aspect":"9:16","projection":"perspective","move":"hold","shot":{"size":"medium","angle":"low"},"location":"garden","view":"real","light":{"key":"right","height":"low","rim":true,"note":{"de":"Untersicht gegen den Abendhimmel: PLF al